────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
                                                                                                    
 ◆ Inbox — Pending Approvals                                                                        
                                                                                                    
   2 proposals awaiting approval.                                                                   
                                                                                                    
   To act on a proposal:                                                                            
   ashlr inbox              — list pending proposals                                                
   ashlr inbox show <id>    — view full diff                                                        
   ashlr inbox approve <id> — approve and apply                                                     
   ashlr inbox reject <id>  — reject and discard                                                    
                                                                                                    
   Approval is CLI-only. Nothing applies automatically.                                             
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
